<FILEMAN_FILE>
<FILE_NAME>REMINDER DIALOG</FILE_NAME>
<FILE_NUMBER>801.41</FILE_NUMBER>
<POINT_01>VA-GP STAGE 3 PRESSURE INJURY INFO</POINT_01>
<INTERNAL_ENTRY_NUMBER>29485</INTERNAL_ENTRY_NUMBER>
<CHECKSUM>3249955351</CHECKSUM>
<SELECTED>NO</SELECTED>
<FILEMAN_FDA>
<![CDATA[
801.41;+29485,;.01~VA-GP STAGE 3 PRESSURE INJURY INFO
801.41;+29485,;4~dialog element
801.41;+29485,;23~YES
801.41;+29485,;25~WP-start~8
Full-thickness loss of skin in which adipose (fat) is visible in the 
ulcer and granulation tissue and epibole (rolled wound edges) are often 
present. Slough and/or eschar may be visible. The depth of tissue damage 
varies by anatomical location; areas of significant adiposity can develop 
deep wounds. Undermining and tunneling may occur. Fascia, muscle, 
tendon, ligament, cartilage and/or bone are not exposed. If slough or 
eschar obscures the extent of tissue loss this is an Unstageable Pressure 
Injury.
801.41;+29485,;51~SUPPRESS
801.41;+29485,;100~NATIONAL
801.41;+29485,;101~Office of Nursing Service
801.412;+29486,+29485,;.01~5
801.412;+29486,+29485,;2~PXRM VANOD PU LOCATIONS
801.412;+29486,+29485,;6~Location(s):
801.412;+29486,+29485,;9~NO
801.44;+29487,+29485,;.01~04/30/2020@11:35:18
801.44;+29487,+29485,;2~WP-start~1
Exchange Stub
]]>
